, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 13, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e9", "type": "text", "x": 44, "y": 0, "width": 544.5, "height": 39.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b1220", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 531725348, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 958804058, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Quién hace qué y cómo se conectan", "originalText": "Quién hace qué y cómo se conectan", "fontSize": 30, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 27, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e10", "type": "text", "x": 44, "y": 46, "width": 899.2500000000001, "height": 19.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 265695474, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1703729685, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Python y el frontend no se llaman entre sí: los dos leen y escriben en Valkey, según docs/contrato-valkey.md.", "originalText": "Python y el frontend no se llaman entre sí: los dos leen y escriben en Valkey, según docs/contrato-valkey.md.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 13, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e11", "type": "rectangle", "x": 0, "y": 84, "width": 1900, "height": 1, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e2e8f0", "backgroundColor": "#e2e8f0", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 212984477, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 949539217, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e12", "type": "rectangle", "x": 30, "y": 110, "width": 520, "height": 500, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e2e8f0", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 200071089, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 571981486, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e13", "type": "rectangle", "x": 30, "y": 110, "width": 5, "height": 500, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ea580c", "backgroundColor": "#ea580c", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1243862423, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1800188483, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e14", "type": "text", "x": 52, "y": 126, "width": 229.9, "height": 28.6, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b1220", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 619570853, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 505913793, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "FRONTEND Y TABLEROS", "originalText": "FRONTEND Y TABLEROS", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 19, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e15", "type": "text", "x": 52, "y": 162.6, "width": 354.75000000000006, "height": 429.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#334155", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1324919353, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 776213900, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Next.js en web/ · rama fe · construye Devin\n\nPantallas, con las palabras de EIRA:\n  1 Subir\n  2 Calidad\n  3 Vista previa (tablero)\n  4 Exportar (informe)\n  + Registro con tarjeta (opcional)\n\nEscribe:\n  el archivo subido\n  el trabajo en la cola\n  las decisiones humanas\n\nLee:\n  estado de cada trabajo\n  fuentes, estrellas, problemas\n  personas, conteos, pares\n\nCalcula en Valkey:\n  personas únicas  SCARD\n  filtros y cruces SINTERCARD", "originalText": "Next.js en web/ · rama fe · construye Devin\n\nPantallas, con las palabras de EIRA:\n  1 Subir\n  2 Calidad\n  3 Vista previa (tablero)\n  4 Exportar (informe)\n  + Registro con tarjeta (opcional)\n\nEscribe:\n  el archivo subido\n  el trabajo en la cola\n  las decisiones humanas\n\nLee:\n  estado de cada trabajo\n  fuentes, estrellas, problemas\n  personas, conteos, pares\n\nCalcula en Valkey:\n  personas únicas  SCARD\n  filtros y cruces SINTERCARD", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 13, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e16", "type": "rectangle", "x": 690, "y": 110, "width": 520, "height": 500, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b1220", "backgroundColor": "#0b1220", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 442620899, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 806899910, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e17", "type": "text", "x": 712, "y": 126, "width": 72.60000000000001, "height": 28.6, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1599435268, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 418461139, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "VALKEY", "originalText": "VALKEY", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 19, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e18", "type": "text", "x": 712, "y": 160, "width": 420.75000000000006, "height": 39.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#cbd5e1", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 269676600, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 255985077, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "rama valkey-base · ya en main\nArranca vacía; la semilla de demostración va aparte", "originalText": "rama valkey-base · ya en main\nArranca vacía; la semilla de demostración va aparte", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 13, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e19", "type": "text", "x": 712, "y": 222, "width": 361.90000000000003, "height": 327.6, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e2e8f0", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 884585952, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2132084005, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "eira:archivo:<id>     bytes del Excel (1 h)\neira:trabajos         Stream: cola de trabajos\neira:trabajo:<id>     estado y mensaje\n\neira:fuentes          archivos importados\neira:fuente:<id>      estrellas, filas, motivos\neira:anom:<id>        problemas de calidad\neira:omitidas:<id>    filas no contadas\n\neira:per:*            Sets de personas\neira:nac              fecha de nacimiento\neira:cnt:<unidad>     conteos por dimensión\neira:sinid            registros sin persona\n\neira:pares            decisiones pendientes\neira:decisiones       Stream: respuesta humana\neira:bitacora         Stream: historial\neira:eventos          Pub/Sub: aviso en vivo", "originalText": "eira:archivo:<id>     bytes del Excel (1 h)\neira:trabajos         Stream: cola de trabajos\neira:trabajo:<id>     estado y mensaje\n\neira:fuentes          archivos importados\neira:fuente:<id>      estrellas, filas, motivos\neira:anom:<id>        problemas de calidad\neira:omitidas:<id>    filas no contadas\n\neira:per:*            Sets de personas\neira:nac              fecha de nacimiento\neira:cnt:<unidad>     conteos por dimensión\neira:sinid            registros sin persona\n\neira:pares            decisiones pendientes\neira:decisiones       Stream: respuesta humana\neira:bitacora         Stream: historial\neira:eventos          Pub/Sub: aviso en vivo", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 12, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e20", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1350, "y": 110, "width": 520, "height": 500, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e2e8f0", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1836494975, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1349251824, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e21", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1350, "y": 110, "width": 5, "height": 500, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2563eb", "backgroundColor": "#2563eb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1999744785, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1946412081, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e22", "type": "text", "x": 1372, "y": 126, "width": 278.3, "height": 28.6, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b1220", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1552984409, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1287489454, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "PROCESAMIENTO EN PYTHON", "originalText": "PROCESAMIENTO EN PYTHON", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 19, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e23", "type": "text", "x": 1372, "y": 162.6, "width": 371.25000000000006, "height": 390.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#334155", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1066984056, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 772092315, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "rama python · compañera de equipo y su agente\n\nToma cada trabajo de la cola y:\n  lee el Excel (encabezados, fechas,\n    totales, hojas)\n  propone el mapeo de columnas\n  detecta duplicados en tres capas\n  unifica programas y reportes\n  califica el archivo con estrellas\n\nEscribe:\n  estado y mensaje del trabajo\n  la fuente y sus problemas\n  cada persona con UN solo\n    identificador opaco\n  conteos por unidad\n  pares que debe decidir una persona\n  aviso de que terminó\n\nNunca escribe nombres completos", "originalText": "rama python · compañera de equipo y su agente\n\nToma cada trabajo de la cola y:\n  lee el Excel (encabezados, fechas,\n    totales, hojas)\n  propone el mapeo de columnas\n  detecta duplicados en tres capas\n  unifica programas y reportes\n  califica el archivo con estrellas\n\nEscribe:\n  estado y mensaje del trabajo\n  la fuente y sus problemas\n  cada persona con UN solo\n    identificador opaco\n  conteos por unidad\n  pares que debe decidir una persona\n  aviso de que terminó\n\nNunca escribe nombres completos", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 13, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e24", "type": "arrow", "x": 550, "y": 200, "width": 140, "height": 0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 2}, "seed": 1048386556, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 351564608, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [140, 0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "elbowed": false}, {"id": "e25", "type": "text", "x": 562.2, "y": 176, "width": 112.2, "height": 15.600000000000001, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1289560150, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2126508551, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "archivo + trabajo", "originalText": "archivo + trabajo", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 10, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e26", "type": "arrow", "x": 1210, "y": 200, "width": 140, "height": 0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, 