"angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e2e8f0", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 937195260, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1234510746, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e45", "type": "rectangle", "x": 650, "y": 810, "width": 5, "height": 380, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#059669", "backgroundColor": "#059669", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 555512016, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1063497604, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e46", "type": "text", "x": 672, "y": 826, "width": 176.0, "height": 26.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b1220", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1708957521, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1679116189, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2  LA MISMA FILA", "originalText": "2  LA MISMA FILA", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 18, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e47", "type": "text", "x": 672, "y": 860.0, "width": 354.75000000000006, "height": 253.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#334155", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2132480061, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 346094056, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "rosa_v2.xlsx = lo de antes + 8 filas\n  → \"Parece una versión nueva: 122 filas\n     ya estaban y se omiten; se agregan 8.\"\n\nnutricion.xlsx comparte 30 filas\n  → \"Comparte 30 filas con 'rosa.xlsx'.\n     Se cuentan una sola vez.\"\n\nPresidencia puede restituir una fila con\n\"Contar de todos modos\" (queda en bitácora)\n\nCómo: una huella por fila que no depende\ndel archivo", "originalText": "rosa_v2.xlsx = lo de antes + 8 filas\n  → \"Parece una versión nueva: 122 filas\n     ya estaban y se omiten; se agregan 8.\"\n\nnutricion.xlsx comparte 30 filas\n  → \"Comparte 30 filas con 'rosa.xlsx'.\n     Se cuentan una sola vez.\"\n\nPresidencia puede restituir una fila con\n\"Contar de todos modos\" (queda en bitácora)\n\nCómo: una huella por fila que no depende\ndel archivo", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 13, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e48", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1270, "y": 810, "width": 600, "height": 380, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e2e8f0", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 714537755, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1929245187, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e49", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1270, "y": 810, "width": 5, "height": 380, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4f46e5", "backgroundColor": "#4f46e5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1725048951, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1193309984, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e50", "type": "text", "x": 1292, "y": 826, "width": 209.00000000000003, "height": 26.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b1220", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 588093311, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1849076401, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3  LA MISMA PERSONA", "originalText": "3  LA MISMA PERSONA", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 18, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e51", "type": "text", "x": 1292, "y": 860.0, "width": 354.75000000000006, "height": 234.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#334155", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1195809358, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1783684942, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Mismo ID de EIRA y mismo nombre\n  → una persona, sin preguntar\n\nMismo ID y nombre distinto\n  → \"¿Es la misma persona escrita distinto,\n     o son dos personas con el mismo ID?\"\n     Decide una persona; hasta entonces\n     cuentan como una.\n\nID de EIRA = iniciales + fecha de\nnacimiento (AAAAMMDD). Puede chocar:\nEIRA ya lo sabe y lo quiere ver.", "originalText": "Mismo ID de EIRA y mismo nombre\n  → una persona, sin preguntar\n\nMismo ID y nombre distinto\n  → \"¿Es la misma persona escrita distinto,\n     o son dos personas con el mismo ID?\"\n     Decide una persona; hasta entonces\n     cuentan como una.\n\nID de EIRA = iniciales + fecha de\nnacimiento (AAAAMMDD). Puede chocar:\nEIRA ya lo sabe y lo quiere ver.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 13, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e52", "type": "text", "x": 0, "y": 1286, "width": 16.5, "height": 19.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e11d48", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1540910401, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1633982922, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "03", "originalText": "03", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 13, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e53", "type": "text", "x": 44, "y": 1280, "width": 379.50000000000006, "height": 39.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b1220", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 991070208, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 648200382, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Cómo se vería (bocetos)", "originalText": "Cómo se vería (bocetos)", "fontSize": 30, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 27, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e54", "type": "text", "x": 44, "y": 1326, "width": 1146.75, "height": 19.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 356416555, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 756849393, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Cabecera con los cuatro pasos. Español, letra de 16 px o más, estados con texto además de color. Las capturas reales van en docs/capturas/.", "originalText": "Cabecera con los cuatro pasos. Español, letra de 16 px o más, estados con texto además de color. Las capturas reales van en docs/capturas/.", "font